<title>USA: Jayhawk Acceptance files for Chapter 11.</title>
<headline>Jayhawk Acceptance files for Chapter 11.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jayhawk Acceptance Corp said Monday that it has filed a voluntary petition for reorganization under Chapter 11 of the U.S. Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>The company had previously announced that it would file for bankruptcy. It said the filing was necessary to adequately serve its dealers and preserve shareholders' equity.</p>
<p>Jayhawk Acceptance is a specialized financial services company.</p>
</text>
